{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-09_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-09","title":"小镇翳云","storyCode":"13-11","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f915502c665e462cf341e24e28bc746bc9a9ab055c9af7c97c1e7a65b67506f2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"公告\n一、居民必须遵守军事委员会此前颁布的一切条款\n二、务必遵守上工安全规定，所有人不可旷工\n三、严禁晚上七点之后私自离开住处活动\n四、禁止任何悼念镇长韦斯特先生的行为\n布伦特伍德镇代理镇长\n芙蕾达·韦斯特"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我还没有拿到种子。\n还来得及在明年的农事节庆典前准备好那些花吗？\n我不希望家族的传统结束在我的手里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，玛格达尔，嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你昨晚喝醉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我带着老汉克悄悄地......尝了“一点点”镇长留下的酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"偷偷告诉你，韦斯特先生可不止为庆典酿了好酒！嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"——他居然还背着所有人偷偷藏了一门大礼炮！上次见到那东西还是我们十岁那年的农事节呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"明年过节的时候，我一定要在烟火声里邀请你跳舞，玛格达尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醉得真厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......祈祷那些挨着酒桶的闪光粉不会受潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没几天了，等我们建完那些魔族佬要求的奇怪东西，他们就会乖乖滚蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，等到明年农事节，我们就终于可以彻夜狂欢，庆祝我们的生活回到过去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——你什么时候开始在温室里挂钟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在早就过了小镇集体上工的时间。你今天旷工了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"少一个人不会被发现的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我这不是正准备过去嘛，我知道你温室后面有一条小径直通工地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，说来那些魔族佬真的很少在你这边晃悠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"门在这边......我马上就过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"回见！嗝——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，威尔！别开那个门！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"痛痛痛——玛格达尔，我头上是不是被花盆开了个口子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事也没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你还醉着。出去的门在那边，我陪你去工地吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我得带上一束花去纪念一下韦斯特先生，真遗憾他喝不上自己酿的好酒了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没看到今天刚贴出来的公告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"什么公告，嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，拿上这束花吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"布伦特伍德镇近几年肉眼可见地衰落了。\n韦斯特先生曾绞尽脑汁试图扭转现状，但效果寥寥，曾经络绎不绝的车队再也不愿光临这座被遗忘的小镇。\n随时迫近的战争和伦蒂尼姆日渐糟糕的局势压得所有人喘不过气来。\n大半个月前，我们所有人聚在市政中心的塔楼上，看到远处腾空而起的天灾云，那是伦蒂尼姆的方向。\n韦斯特先生犹豫了半天，还是放弃了派一支队伍去伦蒂尼姆确认情况的打算。只有些传言，“战争爆发了”。\n直到萨卡兹到来，小镇才重新“热闹”起来，他们用粮食雇佣了我们所有人大动土木。\n大家争先恐后地每日排队领号，努力上工换取有限的粮食。我们很努力，短短的几周时间里，他们让我们建造的东西就已经初具雏形。\n在活下去的诱惑面前，大家竭力忘记，韦斯特先生到底是为何而死。\n可既然都没有人再去农田里劳作了......\n那大家心心念念的农事节又是为什么而庆祝呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尔，他们走过来了，快醒醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，威尔......我提醒过你少喝点！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，他违反了我们的规定，我现在就把他扔进禁闭室里好好反省。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出你很享受我们赏你的权力，菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......只是不想任何人违反我们定好的规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我都能看出来你想保他，幼稚的把戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好记得你的倒霉父亲为什么会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"大君没有追究你们之前态度摇摆的罪责，就已经是对你们最大的奖赏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我们要的是老实干活的人，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我......下次不会了，长官。我发誓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"腿抖就对了，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，你会活得好好的，你要是死了，我*萨卡兹粗口*还得再找个人填你的缺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会盯好他的，保证不会延误任何工期......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"最好这样。他落下的工期你们谁补上都行，我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你，不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"滚回你自己的岗位去，我不想头儿找我麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹监工","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"滚吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔，麻烦你了。把他交给我吧，他会在禁闭室里乖乖醒酒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我酒已经醒了！他们定下的工期我不敢耽误......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先能站稳再逞强吧。你要是真又倒在工地上，我也救不了你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，昨晚真不该把仓库钥匙借给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些花......是送我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，当然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是我准备用来悼念韦斯特先生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没看到我今天新贴的公告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他昨天喝多了，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，芙蕾达......昨天本来只想喝一点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"——但是汤姆那个混球沾酒就胡说，他骂你就是仗着魔族佬气焰的叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"大家现在还能勉强过日子，难道不是你低声下气从魔族佬那求来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我和老汉克气不过就和他赌酒，结果一不小心没收住，嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们的看法不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，花给我，我替父亲谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们可以在韦斯特先生为农事节做准备的库房里偷偷办个悼念仪式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们萨卡兹很少会去那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，玛格达尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜这些花是你准备的，他还没聪明到学会这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你该回去了，我刚听说......镇子附近前几天来了批外人，不是公爵的军队，但他们有武装。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹害怕镇子里出内应，他们会提前开始今天的搜查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提前搜查？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她跑这么快是有什么急事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了你自己的小命考虑，我劝你少去烦她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她有自己的麻烦要处理。走吧，乖乖去禁闭室醒酒，唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手下看到你去了工地，“园丁”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要消耗我对你的信任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怎么才能把他打发走？\n希望他什么都没有发现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我给你的钟挂了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这很好，那就牢牢记住自己的工时，不要轻易离开这个岗位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他手上有泥。\n他擅自给我的雏菊翻了土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没准手下进你的温室乱动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你大可以光明正大地检查，不用一直背对我小心翼翼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你在找它们？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呼，幸好只是那些种子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些种子，不在我批准的交易清单里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你从什么渠道得到这些东西，我劝你不要再干类似的蠢事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从今天起，任何举止异常的可疑人员我们会直接处决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和你说这些事干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，老实点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安静得恐怖。\n我该不该转过身去看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢你培育的这些花，“玫瑰”，卡兹戴尔从来没有这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天起，我需要去镇外指挥战斗，不会再经常过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你会很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿把这些花送到我的营帐里，“园丁”，这枚硬币就是订金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后，一个忠告，不要再靠近镇中心的工地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这些恐怖的人居然也会对脆弱的花草感兴趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！我的玫瑰......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洁白的花瓣上晕染了血液。\n他的手被玫瑰的刺扎破了？\n他不会感觉到痛吗？\n奇怪的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在安全了！你们还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——终于出来了，里面好挤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稳重一点，你刚才是不是差点就打算动手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我们还不能马上给这里惹麻烦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，洛洛小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是费斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到今天他们会提前搜查，听说，镇子外面出现了一批......“武装人员”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的两人互相看了一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们给你添麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔，对吧？布伦特伍德......这个镇子的情况和我们预计的不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该说是糟糕吗......可是，这里居然维持了表面上的“和平”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在为萨卡兹服务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哪怕这位名叫费斯特的少年脸上有很多风霜打磨的痕迹，我依然能看到他清澈眼睛中的无畏勇气。\n洛洛小姐似乎是他的搭档，我能想象他们并肩作战的样子。\n......我已经很久没有在小镇里看到如此热忱的朝气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们小镇......的确都在为萨卡兹办事。洛洛小姐有疑虑也是很正常的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们之前告诉我说你们是难民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你们应该不只是从伦蒂尼姆逃出来，想要讨资源的难民吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，之前还没有来得及表明身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都是伦蒂尼姆市民自救军的成员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆......可为什么你们会出现在这个地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，说来话长。这个故事我们可以慢慢讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，首先，能告诉我们萨卡兹在这个镇子的中心，正在建什么东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔——我们的顾问很担心这里在建的东西，我和费斯特也尝试接近了那片工地，但萨卡兹的守备很严密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只能看到一片巨大的血色结晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是规模还是复杂程度，比我们之前所见的，都要......更高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们的意思是，我们在建的这个东西，并不是唯一的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们相信，这是萨卡兹们的一种战争法阵，但布伦特伍德的这一座，恐怕更加特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的部队正在筹划进攻这里，虽然我们的战士们......状态并不算好，但如果能得到你们的帮助——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"战场。\n自从大公爵们围住伦蒂尼姆的消息传来之后，越来越多的人讨论起那个无比遥远的战场。\n但他们只会躲在萨卡兹的视线之外可悲地畅想。\n他们在微醺中吹嘘，公爵的军舰会沿着他们在地图上胡乱画下的路线拯救维多利亚。\n他们会在睡梦中幻想，萨卡兹将在他们的振臂欢呼中逃离布伦特伍德镇。\n可战场到底是什么样？\n我从这个被萨卡兹掌控的宁静小镇中看不到一丝一毫。\n我也不想看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹们......很快就会离开了。我们的镇子里，不会有他们想要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生，洛洛小姐，你们还是赶紧离开吧，外来人在小镇里会很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以从温室后面的小径岔路走，那边不会有萨卡兹巡逻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔小姐，布伦特伍德虽然不在任何公爵和萨卡兹直接对垒的前线，但......这里的状况很反常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是这些年布伦特伍德的物资流动情况，还是似乎被有意忽视的地位，还有，你们在建设的这个巨大法术节点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些源石结晶是从哪里运来的？为什么萨卡兹能在短短几周的时间里，布置如此周密的计划？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这样显得有点难堪，但我们的确还没有摸清楚，萨卡兹究竟想要干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这绝不是个好迹象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔小姐，如果你能帮助我们说服大家帮忙，我们还有机会提前阻止他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是帮我们查明萨卡兹军队在小镇的驻扎情况——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们不必躲了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军的各位，你们好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（费斯特，原定的撤退路线没问题。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（静观其变，不能放弃拉拢他们的机会。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（如果凯尔希医生的判断无误，军事委员会在这里的谋划，一定......极端重要。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我只是来顺道帮朋友道一声谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔，威尔说他刚刚忘了向你道谢，委托我一定要帮他传达心意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，他从小就总是有些不切实际的幻想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（气氛好像不太对。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（听上去威尔好像是之前那个差点掀开我们藏身柜子的醉酒小混蛋？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（......嘘，别多事。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......芙蕾达，这两位自救军的事情麻烦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我介绍一下他们的情况吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我刚在外面听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达......镇长——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布伦特伍德镇的镇长是我的父亲，他已经牺牲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对于这座小镇，很......幸运，他是至今唯一的牺牲者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，我只能拒绝你们的请求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我敬佩你们反抗他们的勇气......可我不能赌上全镇人的性命去冒险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲有过和你们一样的想法，但他已经付出了代价。反抗只会造成无意义的牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的军营就在温室正门的不远处，为了你们自己的安全，请尽快离开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布伦特伍德会自己解决问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不敢再轻易打碎求之不易的和平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达，你没看出来这其中有问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们已经向我做出了承诺，他们会在计划完成之后离开——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然相信萨卡兹的承诺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我们撤退吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达镇长，我们会一直在周边活动。我们......在等待与其他部队合流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们需要帮助，或者......情况起了变化，我们随时都在，这是我们的承诺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我和芙蕾达并没有那么熟悉，她从小就不合群。\n如果不是威尔总用各种借口拉着芙蕾达上我这里买花，我可能都不会认识她。\n我也许会和其他人一样，只当她是个拖上全镇人为萨卡兹卖命的疯子。\n我可能会忘记，她不过是一个和我年纪相同的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在韦斯特先生牺牲后，你的确救下了我们所有人的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，靠我卖掉全镇人自由换来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但总要有一个恶人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕大家只有一点活下去的机会，我也不敢放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些萨卡兹的头领，那个总来你温室里的军官......他起码没有像那些传言中的萨卡兹一样，以杀人为乐。那么，我宁愿维持现状......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说实话，我也不知道我该相信什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔，我真羡慕你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请原谅威尔的纠缠，他只是有点孩子气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有生过他的气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我偷偷为明年庆典买的那些种子你收到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中间有些波折，但好在最后还是拿到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，希望明年农事节庆典的时候，这些种子能开出最美的花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲已经为这场庆典准备了很久，我不想半途而废。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我的荣幸，芙蕾达。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
